# Plow Through, second mode: "Destroy target Vehicle." Bot2's Smuggler's Copter is a Vehicle that nobody has crewed, so it is
# not a creature, and it is a legal target (CR 205.3g): it is destroyed. Bot2's Sol Ring is an artifact that is no Vehicle, and
# is refused (the refusal), with the Copter beside it as the positive control. Sol Ring and Mox Pearl stay put.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Plow Through
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Smuggler's Copter
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Plow Through.Cast
Bot1.Modes(Destroy target Vehicle)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot2.Battlefield = Mox Pearl; Sol Ring
Bot2.Graveyard = Smuggler's Copter
Bot1.Graveyard = Plow Through
